\begin{description}
\item[* name:] RIdentSentadvVar
\item[* relevant examples:] Probably, he is our new manager; For that reason, 
we are the champions
\item[* language:] (Dutch, English, Spanish) English
\item[* kind of rule:] (M-rule, S-rule, Transferrule) M-rule
